# Copy this file to .env.local (git-ignored) for local dev, and add the
# same key in your host's environment variables (e.g. Vercel → Settings →
# Environment Variables) for production.
#
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com — enter the email you want
# messages delivered to, no signup/account needed, and they email you an
# access key instantly. Paste it below.
#
# Without this key, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's
# own email app with the message pre-filled — it still works with zero
# setup, it just isn't a silent in-page send. See README → "Contact form".
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
